msgid "CAMERA_INFORMATION, CAMERA_SETTINGS, CAMERA_FOV_STATUS include information useful for GCSs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-camera.rst:949
#: 2c31177f95f54348bf5eaeb77025a11f
msgid "These three messages include information that can be useful for the ground station."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-camera.rst:951
#: 44355564186147f59798f426fe0f3caf
msgid "`CAMERA_INFORMATION <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#CAMERA_INFORMATION>`__ includes vendor and model name, firmware version, sensor size, sensor resolution and camera capabilities."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-camera.rst:952
#: 467c1f063f6749869d41ad6c6c29b6cd
msgid "`CAMERA_SETTINGS <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#CAMERA_SETTINGS>`__ is much simpler and only includes the mode, zoom level and focus level."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-camera.rst:953
#: d35d834544d34d94a5bc2f850fc0cdd5
msgid "`CAMERA_FOV_STATUS <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#CAMERA_FOV_STATUS>`__ includes the location (lat, lon, alt) of the camera (or more accurately the vehicle), the location of what the camera gimbal is pointing at and the camera attitude (expressed as a quaternion)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-camera.rst:955
#: 053c9326a68c4a609412aa20cdbf3d17
msgid "A ground station can request the messages be sent just once using the `MAV_CMD_REQUEST_MESSAGE  <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_REQUEST_MESSAGE>`__ command or at regular intervals using `MAV_CMD_SET_MESSAGE_INTERVAL  <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_SET_MESSAGE_INTERVAL>`__ as described on the :ref:`Requesting Data From The Autopilot <mavlink-requesting-data>` page."
msgstr ""

